From: Pierre-Hugues Husson <phh@phh.me>
Date: Tue, 11 Aug 2026 08:50:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Add a property to cap declared le vendor version. Found
 needed on unisoc

[ported to lineage-23.2/A16: controller.cc -> controller_impl.cc; early
returns call vendor_promise.set_value() first per A16 convention (L21 bare
return would leave the promise unsatisfied); cap checks extended to the new
A16 v1.03/v1.04/v1.05 capability blocks]

Change-Id: I4c8a1f9e6a1f4b2g9f7f1e5g3b3d0e32e86b5285
---
